                <pb facs="0522" n="420" sameAs="frus:frus1908/pg420"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 6775/573.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt
                        to the President of Guatemala.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The White House</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1908-09-20"><hi rendition="#italic">September 20,
                        1908</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>It affords me pleasure to acknowledge your telegram and to convey my
                    congratulations upon the auspicious inauguration of the international Central
                    American Bureau.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Theodore
                    Roosevelt.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
